    "# IRC Conversation Disentanglement Training on Google Colab\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains a BERT-based model for IRC conversation disentanglement with memory optimization for Colab GPUs/TPUs.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Features:**\n",
    "- Automatic hardware detection (GPU/TPU/CPU)\n",
    "- Memory optimization for different Colab tiers\n",
    "- Automatic dataset download and processing\n",
    "- Mixed precision training\n",
    "- Gradient checkpointing\n",
    "- Real-time training visualization"
   ]
  },
